{"product": {"id": 6236655255740, "title": "Cortech Cobra Mini Can Trash Receptacle \u2013 710 / 714", "body_html": "<p>The <strong>Cortech Cobra Mini Can Trash Receptacle</strong> is a small, virtually unbreakable trash can for cells, patient rooms, offices, and other rooms in correctional and behavioral healthcare facilities. It comes in 10 and 14 quart sizes and is sold in cases of 6.</p>\n<p>The can is rotationally molded in one piece from high impact \u201cno break\u201d polyethylene, so it will not dent, rust, or chip. A rolled rim adds strength and holds the liner in place.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Material:</strong> One-piece rotationally molded high impact \u201cno break\u201d polyethylene</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Sizes:</strong> 10 quart (710) or 14 quart (714)</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Rim:</strong> Rolled rim for extra strength and to secure liners</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Durability:</strong> Virtually unbreakable; will not dent, rust, or chip</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Antimicrobial Testing:</strong> Tested to ISO 22196, showing a greater than 99% reduction in bacteria</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Flammability Standards:</strong> Flame retardant; passes California Technical Bulletin 133 and UL 94 HB</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Colors:</strong> Aqua, Black, Blue Gray, Brown, Burgundy, Canvas, Claylight, Gray, Green, Indigo, Midnight Blue, Moss, Overcast, Sand, Seagrass, Slate Blue, Stone Gray, or Tide (custom colors available on request)</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Packaging:</strong> Sold in cases of 6</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Warranty:</strong> Lifetime warranty against manufacturing defects</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Country of Manufacture:</strong> USA, made to ISO quality standards</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Available Models and Options</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>710 \u2013 10 Quart:</strong> Cobra Mini Can, case of 6</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>714 \u2013 14 Quart:</strong> Cobra Mini Can, case of 6</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Applications</h2>\n<p>The Cobra Mini Can suits rooms that need a small trash can that will not break.</p>\n<p>Typical applications include:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Cells and housing units in correctional facilities and jails</li>\n  <li>Patient rooms in behavioral healthcare facilities and psychiatric hospitals</li>\n  <li>Offices, bathrooms, and other small rooms in secure facilities</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Explore Anchortex's <a href=\"https://www.anchortex.com/collections/janitorial-and-sanitation-supplies\">Prison Janitorial and Sanitation Supplies</a> collection for more trash receptacles and sanitation supplies.</p>\n<h2>About Cortech Facilities Maintenance</h2>\n<p>Cortech facilities maintenance products are molded to stand up to hard daily use in correctional facilities, behavioral healthcare facilities, and other high-abuse settings.</p>\n<p>Cortech facilities maintenance includes:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Trash Receptacles:</strong> Cobra Cans in 20 to 55 gallon sizes, in flame retardant or food grade and general use material, and Cobra Mini Cans in 10 and 14 quart sizes</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Can Dollies:</strong> Cobra Can dollies in two sizes</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Carts:</strong> Kangaroo Carts and lids for laundry, trash, and material handling</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>About Cortech</h2>\n<p>Cortech manufactures durable molded furniture for demanding environments, including behavioral healthcare facilities, psychiatric hospitals, correctional institutions, law enforcement facilities, and homeless and emergency shelters. Explore the full line of <a href=\"https://www.anchortex.com/collections/cortech-usa\">Cortech Behavioral Health and Prison Furniture</a> at Anchortex.</p>", "vendor": "Cortech", "product_type": "", "created_at": "2021-01-29T16:19:21-05:00", "handle": "cortech-cobra-mini-can-trash-receptacle", "updated_at": "2026-11-20T11:37:50-05:00", "published_at": "2021-01-29T16:19:20-05:00", "template_suffix": null, "published_scope": "web", "tags": "cortech-usa, prison-janitorial", "variants": [{"id": 37962794107068, "product_id": 62366552